# Version control
.git
.gitignore
.github

# IDE / editors
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
.cursorrules
AGENTS.md

# .NET build artefacts — Docker rebuilds these inside the container
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Node / Next.js artefacts (not applicable to .NET context but present for checklist completeness)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# Test projects — source excluded, .csproj kept so dotnet restore DineOS.slnx can find them
tests/**/*.cs
tests/**/*.json
tests/**/*.md
**/TestResults/
**/TestResults-ci/

# Environment secrets
.env*
!.env.example

# Runtime-mounted volumes — not baked into the image
keycloak/
grafana/
loki/

# Docker metadata
docker-compose.yml

# Documentation
README.md
docs/

# OS metadata
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
